OL,3,GNEWSAPoet says being dropped from
OL,4,ASenedd royal visit over poem is
OL,5,A'concerning'
OL,6,
OL,7,FWales' national poet has said it is
OL,8,F"quite concerning" that a poem raising
OL,9,Fpolitical issues was rejected from the
OL,10,FSenedd's opening ceremony.
OL,12,FBriefings to the media about the event
OL,13,Fsaid a poetry reading would be made by
OL,14,FHanan Issa at the ceremony on Thursday,
OL,15,Fwhich will be attended by King Charles
OL,16,FIII and Queen Camilla.
OL,18,FBut on Wednesday, Issa posted on social
OL,19,Fmedia that the poem she submitted, To
OL,20,FGrow, which referred to Gaza and trans
OL,21,Fhealthcare, was rejected on the grounds
OL,22,Fthat the ceremony was "apolitical".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
