OL,3,GNEWSAPoet says being dropped from
OL,4,ASenedd royal visit over poem is
OL,5,A'concerning'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Senedd Commission said the poem,
OL,8,Fthat Issa had reworked and had already
OL,9,Fbeen translated into Welsh, was "not
OL,10,Fthe right fit for this occasion".
